#: ../../devops/elasticstack.rst:2
msgid "Elastic Stack"
msgstr "Elastic Stack"

#: ../../devops/elasticstack.rst:4
msgid "Elastic Stack 能够安全可靠地获取任何来源、任何格式的数据，并且能够实时地对数据进行搜索、分析和可视化。"
msgstr "Elastic Stack can securely and reliably ingest data from any source and in any format, and can search, analyze, and visualize that data in real time."

#: ../../devops/elasticstack.rst:6
msgid "我们主要用到 Elastic Stack 中的以下组件："
msgstr "We mainly use the following components of Elastic Stack:"

#: ../../devops/elasticstack.rst:8
msgid "Elasticsearch, 分布式的 RESTful 风格的搜索和数据分析引擎，集中存储数据"
msgstr "Elasticsearch, a distributed RESTful-style search and data analytics engine, for centralized data storage"

#: ../../devops/elasticstack.rst:9
msgid "Filebeat, 轻量型采集器，用于汇总日志数据转发到 Elasticsearch"
msgstr "Filebeat, a lightweight shipper for aggregating log data and forwarding it to Elasticsearch"

#: ../../devops/elasticstack.rst:10
msgid "Kibana, 以图表的形式呈现数据，并且具有可扩展的用户界面"
msgstr "Kibana, presents data as charts, with an extensible user interface"

#: ../../devops/elasticstack.rst:11
msgid "X-Pack, 使传输和存储的数据始终享有可靠的安全保障"
msgstr "X-Pack, keeps data secure at all times, both in transit and at rest"

#: ../../devops/elasticstack.rst:14
msgid "Elasticsearch"
msgstr "Elasticsearch"

#: ../../devops/elasticstack.rst:15
msgid "Elasticsearch 是一个高性能的开源的分布式全文检索和分析工具，用于实时存储、检索、分析大数据。"
msgstr "Elasticsearch is a high-performance, open source, distributed full-text search and analytics tool for real-time storage, retrieval, and analysis of big data."

